    featuredImagePrompt: "A wide-angle, cinematic scene depicting a monumental handshake between two abstract, powerful figures in a futuristic, digital boardroom setting. One figure subtly represents the world of video gaming and sports, perhaps with glowing holographic elements of game interfaces or sports arenas in the background. The other figure represents vast financial investment, with subtle golden or oil-sheikh-like accents, and a landscape of futuristic skyscrapers and data flowing around them. The color palette should be rich and serious, blending deep blues, purples, and golds, emphasizing the scale and impact of a $55 billion deal. The scene should convey both business power and the digital future of entertainment, with a clear sense of transition from public to private ownership indicated by subtle lighting shifts. The composition should draw the eye to the central agreement, with a focus on global implications.",
