    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the aftermath of the Oscars. Focus on a stylized golden Oscar statuette at the center, surrounded by a swirling, dynamic abstract composition that blends elements of triumph (radiant light, flowing gold) and disappointment (subtle dark shadows, fractured glass effects). Incorporate subtle, abstract hints of Hollywood glamour and global reach, perhaps faint outlines of city skylines or continents in the background. The overall mood should convey both the excitement of victory and the lingering questions of 'what if.' Use a rich color palette of gold, deep blues, and muted purples, with sharp contrasts to represent the divided verdict.",
