    featuredImagePrompt: "A visually striking data-driven graphic representing soaring AI startup valuations with an upward-trending bar or line graph, sharply contrasted with a subtle, ominous red graph line or a warning sign (like a subtle 'caution' triangle or a 'market risk' icon) superimposed. The background should be a subtle, futuristic tech interface, perhaps with abstract representations of neural networks or data streams. The overall composition should convey both rapid growth and underlying volatility, suitable for a financial news article about investment booms and market warnings. Avoid human figures. Focus on abstract data visualization and a professional, clean aesthetic, ensuring uniqueness from previous conceptual or wide-angle visuals.",
