      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A moderately bullish outlook (60% probability) is warranted. Tether\'s financial strength and Bybit\'s innovation are strong positive signals. However, the pace of regulatory clarity (25% risk of significant delay/negative policy) and broader market sentiment (15% risk of sustained downturn) remain critical variables that could shift the trajectory.",
