      bullCase: "The increasing mainstream integration, exemplified by Galaxy Digital\'s stadium deal, suggests a long-term maturation of the crypto market. As institutional players commit significant capital and brand recognition, it lends credibility and stability, potentially attracting a wider user base and driving further innovation. Regulatory clarity, though sometimes restrictive, could ultimately de-risk the sector for larger traditional investors, paving the way for more robust financial products and services.",
